# Ziggfreed Common, additions to Hytale's own "server" language namespace, en-US.
# This file's basename ("server") targets the engine's built-in namespace, not the library's
# "ziggfreedcommon" one. Server-shipped .lang files merge per key into a namespace, so this file
# adds only new keys and never overrides one the engine owns.
#
# The in-game trigger-volume inspector names a condition type by
# customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.conditionType.<TypeId>.
customUI.triggerVolumeEffectEditor.conditionType.ZigRequires = Gerektirir
